WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.699 --> 00:00:07.762
In this guide, you will connect your own Telegram bot to Castvoo.

2
00:00:07.892 --> 00:00:09.773
It takes about a minute.

3
00:00:10.074 --> 00:00:13.235
Go to Channels and bots, and tap Add a bot.

4
00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:16.341
Now open BotFather in Telegram.

5
00:00:16.471 --> 00:00:19.937
It is Telegram's official tool for making bots.

6
00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:22.498
Send it the command /newbot.

7
00:00:22.628 --> 00:00:26.296
Then pick a name, and a username that ends in "bot".

8
00:00:26.596 --> 00:00:29.091
BotFather replies with a token.

9
00:00:29.221 --> 00:00:32.163
It is a long code with a colon in the middle.

10
00:00:32.293 --> 00:00:34.532
Copy it, and keep it private.

11
00:00:34.832 --> 00:00:38.324
Back in Castvoo, paste the token into this box.

12
00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:39.965
One tip.

13
00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:45.453
If this bot already runs another service, connecting it here takes over its updates.

14
00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:47.555
Tap Connect bot.

15
00:00:47.685 --> 00:00:50.825
Castvoo checks it with Telegram in a few seconds.

16
00:00:51.126 --> 00:00:52.863
And you are connected.

17
00:00:52.993 --> 00:00:54.779
Your bot is live.

18
00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:58.352
Share your bot's link, so people can press Start.

19
00:00:58.482 --> 00:01:02.278
Everyone who does becomes a subscriber you can message.

20
00:01:02.578 --> 00:01:06.241
Your bot now shows here, with how many people it can reach.

21
00:01:06.371 --> 00:01:08.801
Next, add your channel or group.
